2.       Duties
 The AC shall undertake the following duties and report to the Board of Directors:-
a) to review quarterly results and year-end financial statements of Atrium REIT and the Company before 
submission to the Board for approval, focusing particularly on:
i. the going concern assumption;
ii. any changes in or implementation of major accounting policies and practices;
iii.   significant issues arising from the audit including financial reporting issues, significant and unusual 
events or transactions, and how these matters are addressed;
iv. compliance with accounting standards, regulatory and other legal requirements; and
v. any major judgmental matters.
